==Battleground==
*5 [[Devil Wife|Devil Wives]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Shibalien Elite]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 30~36.67 seconds<sup>900f~1,100f</sup>.
*1 [[Wicked Face]] spawns as the boss after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*30 [[Miz Devil]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*2 [[Techn-Old Hyena]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 86.67 seconds<sup>2,600f</sup>.
*2 [[Mesocosmocyclone]]s spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 93.33 seconds<sup>2,800f</sup>.
*5 [[Miz Devil]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*5 [[Shibalien Elite]]s spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
[[Ancient Egg: N004 (Special Cat)|Supercar Cat]] can get in a penetrate the [[Shield|Aku Shield]] of Wicked Face. From there, most mixes of [[:Category:Anti-Alien Cats|Anti-Alien Cats]] and [[:Category:Anti-Aku Cats|Anti-Aku Cats]] can work to destroy this stage. [[Psychocat (Rare Cat)|Psychocat]] is quite good against Mesocosmocyclone, but will struggle against Techn-Old Hyena, so also be sure to have at least one good [[Special Abilities#Sage Slayer|Sage Slayer]]. Additionally, if you can help it, have as many [[:Category:Cats with Warp Immunity|Cats with Warp Immunity]] as physically possible, and do not bring any units that use [[Surge Attack|Surge Attacks]], as Techn-Old Hyena will fire them back at you.

===Recommended Uber ===
*[[Yamii (Uber Rare Cat)|Yaminora]]: Many of the [[Nature's Guardians ELEMENTAL PIXIES (Gacha Event)|Elemental Pixies]] work well here, but one specifically stands above the others, that being Yaminora. It's both an anti-Alien and anti-Aku tanker, and can block the [[Mini-Wave]]s from Wicked Face.

